   394	## 13. KPI and reconciliation framework
   395	
   396	The primary commercial optimisation KPI is **cost per qualified lead**, not reported platform conversions or raw form CPL.
   397	
   398	| KPI | Formula | Use |
   399	|---|---|---|
   400	| Raw CPL | Media spend ÷ valid Snapshot requests, direct enquiries and connected lead calls | Entry-stage efficiency |
   401	| Cost per qualified lead | Media spend ÷ unique CRM-qualified leads | Primary channel KPI |
   402	| Qualified-lead rate | Qualified leads ÷ valid raw leads | Lead-quality diagnostic |
   403	| Cost per proposal | Media spend ÷ proposals sent | Pipeline efficiency |
   404	| CAC | Total attributable acquisition cost ÷ closed-won customers | Commercial efficiency |
   405	| Media-only CAC | Media spend ÷ closed-won customers | Channel comparison; label clearly |
   406	| Lead-to-won rate | Closed-won customers ÷ valid raw leads | Funnel calibration |
   407	| Qualified-lead-to-won rate | Closed-won customers ÷ qualified leads | Target-CPL calibration |
   408	| Target qualified CPL | Target CAC × qualified-lead-to-won rate | Maximum affordable qualified-lead cost |
   409	| Target raw CPL | Target qualified CPL × qualified-lead rate | Maximum affordable raw-lead cost |
   410	| Pipeline value per qualified lead | Expected contribution profit × qualified-lead-to-won probability | Offline conversion value |
   411	| Platform-to-CRM discrepancy | Absolute platform conversions minus matched CRM conversions, divided by CRM conversions | Tracking diagnostic |
   412	| Missing-click-ID rate | Leads without eligible click ID ÷ attributable paid leads | Offline-match diagnostic |
   413	| Duplicate-lead rate | Duplicate lead records ÷ total lead records | CRM integrity |
   414	| Upload success rate | Accepted offline events ÷ eligible events | Pipeline health |
   415	
   416	“Total attributable acquisition cost” should include media, agency/consulting fees, creative, landing-page costs and other agreed acquisition costs. Contribution profit, not headline revenue, should be used for target-CAC decisions where available.
   417	
   418	No target CAC, target qualified CPL or scale threshold should be committed until average contract value, contribution margin, qualification rate and close rate are verified.
