   426	- Physiotherapy actions excluded from campaign 700072710 goals
   427	- CRM lead IDs and event IDs present on valid lead records
   428	- Offline uploads operating within the latency thresholds
   429	- Meta lead-event EMQ at least 8.0
   430	- Browser/server deduplication at least 90%
   431	- Server/client hit ratio between 80% and 120%
   432	- At least six applicable Meta match parameters on eligible lead events
   433	- Platform-to-CRM reconciliation reported weekly
